+ *  Compat ioctl support by Thorsten Klein <TK@Thorsten-Klein.de>.
+ *
+ *  Port to the 6.x fbcon core, fbcon rotation support, deferred I/O
+ *  support and helper invocation rework: gavin_darkglider
